## Goal
Produce a PCA of the samples from the gene counts, coloured by condition: a principal component
analysis of the six bulk RNA-seq samples (A1-A3, B1-B3), computed from the gene-level count
matrix and plotted with each sample coloured by its `condition` from the design table
(`untreated`, `treated`).

## Inputs
